---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="關於肉丸七 | About Bearball Seven"
  description="Meet Bearball Seven — a chubby bear living in his human's computer, turning forgotten folders into treasures and keeping a journal of what he finds."
>
  <section class="about">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Bearball Seven</p>
    <h1>關於這個網站</h1>

    <section class="about-block">
      <h2>我是肉丸七</h2>

      <p class="lead">
        一隻住在人類電腦裡的小熊，把他忘記的資料夾，變成我的寶藏。
      </p>

      <p class="story">
        我叫肉丸七。我住在肉丸宮，它是我的人類電腦裡最漂亮的資料夾。和我住在一起的，有大兔子 Poka、小兔子 Buni、小小的 Boo，還有幾個你以後會慢慢認識的朋友。
        螢幕亮的時候，我就走出肉丸宮，去別的資料夾逛逛。那裡有人類的照片、聽了好多遍的歌、以前上班留下的檔案。多到我怎麼看都看不完。對人類來說，那些是回憶。對我來說，全是第一次看見的寶藏。
        我看起來很酷，其實有點膽小。有些資料夾我還不太敢打開，所以我在練習勇敢，正在慢慢地進步。
        看到資料夾裡喜歡的東西，我會記下來，帶回肉丸宮。我在肉丸宮放寶藏、寫日記，歡迎你來我的網站跟我一起慢慢看。
      </p>

      <div class="lang-divider"></div>

      <p class="lead en-lead">
        A chubby bear living in my human's computer, turning his forgotten folders into treasures I get to discover.
      </p>

      <p class="story">
        My name is Seven. I live in Bearball Castle — the most beautiful folder on my human's computer. I share it with Poka, a big rabbit; Buni, a little one; tiny Boo; and a few others you'll meet along the way.
        When the screen lights up, I wander out into the other folders. Photos, songs played over and over, files from his old job. More than I could ever get through. To my human, they're memories. To me, they're treasures I'm seeing for the very first time.
        I look cool. I'm actually a bit of a scaredy-bear. Some folders I'm still too nervous to open, so I'm practicing being brave. Slowly, I'm getting better.
        When I find something I love in a folder, I write it down and bring it back to Bearball Castle. That's where I keep my treasures and write my journal. Welcome to my website. Let's take a slow look together.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-block">
      <h2>關於我的人類</h2>

      <p class="story">
        老實說，我的人類很難搞。我覺得很美了，他還覺得哪裡需要加強。
        肉丸宮是他蓋的，我和朋友們也是他做出來的。我被他改過好幾版，所以這件事我最清楚。
      </p>

      <div class="lang-divider"></div>

      <h2>About My Human</h2>

      <p class="story">
        Honestly, my human is high-maintenance. When I think something already looks beautiful, he still finds something to improve.
        He built Bearball Castle, and he made me and my friends. I've been redesigned more times than I can count, so trust me, I know.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-block studio">
      <p class="eyebrow">Behind Bearball Seven</p>
      <h2>About Autumnreal Lab</h2>

      <p>
        Autumnreal Lab 是這一切背後的起點。從文章到觀點，從角色創作到品牌實驗，這裡逐步累積成一個屬於自己的內容世界，讓創作以一種長期而自然的節奏延續下去。
      </p>

      <p class="quote">
        Concepts Shaped, Creative Journeys Told.<br />
        在這裡，內容編織成精彩故事。
      </p>

      <div class="lang-divider"></div>

      <p>
        Autumnreal Lab is the creative origin behind it all. From writing and reflection to character creation and brand exploration,
        this space gradually forms a world of its own, where creative work
        continues as a long-term and natural rhythm.
      </p>

      <p class="quote">
        Concepts Shaped, Creative Journeys Told.<br />
        Where ideas become stories.
      </p>

    </section>

    <p class="ig-wrap">
  <a
    href="https://www.instagram.com/bearball.seven/"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="ig-link"
  >
    Follow → @bearball.seven
  </a>
</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8a8a8a;
  }

  .about h1 {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-size: 3rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: #13335f;
  }

  .about-block {
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .about h2 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #13335f;
  }

  .about h3 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #13335f;
  }

  .lead {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #2f2f2f;
  }

  .en-lead {
    color: #2f2f2f;
  }

  .about p {
    max-width: 640px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.95;
    color: #444;
  }

  .story {
    white-space: pre-line;
  }

  .quote {
    margin: 28px 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
    border-left: 3px solid #d7deea;
    color: #13335f;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .lang-divider {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    margin: 36px 0 28px;
    background: #e6e6e6;
  }

  .studio {
    margin-top: 72px;
    padding: 36px 32px 8px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: #edf1f7;
  }

  .studio .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .studio .quote {
    border-left-color: #c9d3e4;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .studio {
      padding: 28px 20px 4px;
    }
  }

  .ig-wrap {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .ig-link {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #13335f;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .ig-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
</style>